# Checked out with LF everywhere, whatever the machine's git is set to. Git for Windows
# installs with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites the working tree to CRLF; the tests that
# read this repository's own files then fail, since a style table parses to nothing and the
# embedded assets stop matching what is committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left byte for byte as they are.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
